@startuml
title ACL Boundary Test - Legacy Read Bridge

actor "Legacy Monolith Consumer" as Consumer
participant "ProductLookupService" as LookupService
participant "ProductLookupAdapter" as LookupAdapter
participant "ProductApplicationService" as ApplicationService

Consumer -> LookupService : requestBarcodeLookup(barcode)
LookupService -> LookupAdapter : findPojoByBarcode(barcode)
LookupAdapter -> ApplicationService : execute(ListProductsQuery)
ApplicationService --> LookupAdapter : PagedProductResult
LookupAdapter -> LookupAdapter : map first item to ProductPojo
LookupAdapter --> LookupService : Optional<ProductPojo>
LookupService --> Consumer : ProductPojo

note right of LookupAdapter
The adapter translates the new Product
module's result objects into legacy
read models for backward compatibility.
end note

@enduml